---

<section id="positioning" class="positioning section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="kicker reveal">
      <span class="kicker__label">Our Thesis</span>
    </div>

    <div class="positioning__grid">
      <div class="positioning__quote-col reveal">
        <blockquote class="pullquote positioning__quote">
          We think like <em>hotel operators</em>, not utility companies. The stop should be worth the time.
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <aside class="positioning__aside reveal">
        <p>
          Every Rangeway location is designed the way a hospitality operator designs a property.
          Lighting, materials, service, sequence. The charging happens inside a space built for
          the people waiting, not outside in a lot built for the car.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .positioning__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
    gap: var(--space-7) clamp(48px, 7vw, 120px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .positioning__quote {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .positioning__aside {
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .positioning__aside p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 40ch;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .positioning__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
